galois-theory","title":"伽罗瓦理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/abstract-algebra/symmetry-and-significance/galois-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications-in-science","title":"群论在科学中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/abstract-algebra/symmetry-and-significance/applications-in-science"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"抽象代数的意义与地位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/abstract-algebra/symmetry-and-significance/significance"}]}]}